  "origin": "Pre-built HRM-Text pretraining dataset produced from raw data using the data_io cleaning scripts (github.com/sapientinc/data_io). English, size category 100B<n<1T rows. Consists mainly of Flan, Platypus, and tasksource sub-collections (per the Mimir technical report's description of the Sapient mixed collection). The largest single source in the Mimir corpus: 11.92B sampled tokens per epoch (16.91% of the corpus). Form: curated + reformatted. Described in the HRM-Text paper (arXiv 2605.20613, Wang et al. 2026).",
